{
  "about": "The spec schema (packages/herceg/spec.schema.json) against herceg's own checks. invalid: specs both refuse, validateSpec at path. unsaid: what herceg checks that the schema cannot say, each with witnesses the schema takes and herceg refuses by it, and patterns of its messages, which the witnesses' refusals or the corpus's each meet; the schema's description and docs/guide/export.md list their text, and every refusal of a spec the schema takes must match one's messages (python/tests/test_spec_schema.py, over scripts/spec-schema-cases.mjs). stricter: what the schema refuses and herceg takes, each with patterns of the places (mark type and option path) where it may, and a witness and its place; the schema's description and the guide list their text too. unprobed: the places (patterns of mark type and option path) where some form of an option is set by no probe in a spec validateSpec takes, whose changes are therefore not made, each with why; every other form a probe sets is set in one.",
